Rules and assets
----------------

The rules engine implements game mechanics from a paraphrased specification
(docs/SPEC.md). The repository does not contain official artwork, logos, card
text, rulebook text, fonts or sound recordings. The board, card and icon
artwork is original SVG drawn for this project, and all sounds are synthesised
at runtime. No bundled asset carries separate licence terms.

